#   where it was. Third stale number in this one file today (blockers,
#   incomplete_entries, this) -- the pattern is not carelessness about
#   any single count, it is that lowering a ratchet has no external
#   caller either: the guard prints the drop and passes, and a passing
#   step is one nobody reads. Rule G8 applies to the baselines too.

